    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b3f9971b599db786c22254",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有被选中的强者才能集结于此，\n世界顶级水平的圣域。\n这是日本比赛界所有人梦寐以求的夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e59fdd4bcada23fe8959a7817b42e8712c97d88b9ef26c9805197219797737",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
